---
description: Use agent-skills workflows from project and user skill folders
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial technical work:

1. Prefer a matching project skill under `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (this repo: `write-insight`, `remove-draft`).
2. Otherwise read and follow `~/.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
3. Open `reference.md` in that folder when the skill links to it.
4. Prefer existing skills over guessing; user does not need to say "read skill" each time.
